# Auto-generated WP Plugin Check scan reports — this plugins/ directory is a
# live WordPress install, and something on that site (not this repo's own
# hooks/build scripts) scans any plugin-shaped folder here and drops a
# {slug}-{slug}-php-{timestamp}.json report in the plugins root. Safe to
# delete locally; never intentionally produced by build.py/build-lite.py.
/*-php-*.json